  "updated_at": "2026-03-08",
  "bio": "Nestled in the vibrant heart of Porto Alegre, Brazil, Cabana Tattoo is a sanctuary for ink enthusiasts seeking the elegance of minimalist and floral designs. Renowned for their masterful blackwork and delicate fine lines, the artisans at Cabana Tattoo tailor each piece with meticulous care, ensuring that every client leaves with a timeless work of art etched upon their skin. Please note, the studio is currently closed temporarily, inviting patrons to anticipate their reopening with excitement for their next tranquil tattoo experience.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Porto Alegre, Rio Grande Do Sul, Brazil"
}